WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.820
You didn't open all those tabs for no reason.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.420
You just don't need them all right now.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:04.980
Bring related work together.

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.720
Review repeat pages, save links for later.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.480
Close only what you choose.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:13.540
Recovery reopens URLs, not unsaved edits.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.100
Your browsing data stays on your device.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.660
Optional local AI adds suggestions and group names on

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.020
supported Chrome devices.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:23.520
The core works without it.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:25.460
I'm building this with the people using it.

00:00:25.860 --> 00:00:27.880
Tell me what missed the point or what would

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:28.920
make it useful tomorrow.

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:31.180
Less tab clutter, more headspace.
